<title>Armenia: SOCCER-GERMANY BEAT ARMENIA 1-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMANY BEAT ARMENIA 1-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ABOVIAN, Armenia 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany beat Armenia 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship group</p>
<p>nine qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Lars Mueller (72nd minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,000</p>
</text>
